      "text": {
        "en": "Grooming outcomes draw mixed feedback. Several pet parents praise tidy cuts, gentle bath treatments, and easy nail trims for nervous dogs, commending Walleed's listening skills. However, one client reported a painful razor burn injury on sensitive areas, and another noted uneven patches after a four-hour session."
      }
    },
