        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the clean, well-stocked layout of the South Street location, highlighting a diverse inventory of pet food, treats, paw protections, and gear. Most reviewers consider it a dependable neighborhood hub, though one customer noted preferring an alternative branch due to changing staff dynamics."
      }
